Profile: BundleIE
Parent: http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/ips/StructureDefinition/Bundle-uv-ips
Id: bundle-ie
Title: "Bundle: Document (FHIR Core Ireland)"
Description: "GOVERNANCE RULE 4 GAP: HL7 Europe Core (hl7.fhir.eu.base#2.0.0) does not define a Bundle profile. This profile
derives from the IPS document Bundle profile (hl7.fhir.uv.ips#2.0.1) instead, per the Rule 4 fallback order, so national
document-type Bundles reuse a European profile rather than being profiled directly from base FHIR.
No further national constraints are introduced in v0.1. Should be retired in favour of an HL7 Europe Bundle profile if/when
one is published."
